  "notes": [
    "The whole registry is one mutable JSON blob in the artifact bucket: register_wiki does read-modify-write with no locking, so two concurrent generations lose one of the entries. ADR-0022 decision 3 replaces it with a `wikis` table.",
    "artifact_status is written as all-true unconditionally — it records intent, not the presence of the artifacts.",
    "created_at is preserved on update; updated_at is rewritten. Both are naive datetime.utcnow() + 'Z'."
